ad doble, potencia McNemar y coste"}", "origin": "completion"}, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-46c4d868-9fc1-4db2-8e50-646102d32e17", "security_risk": "UNKNOWN", "critic_result": null, "summary": "Protocolo SSP→ASR: factorial pareado, adaptatividad doble, potencia McNemar y coste", "kind": "ActionEvent"}
